# docsy-main Development Guidelines

Lineamientos del stack y la estructura del repo. Última revisión: 2026-05-09

## Active Technologies

- Go (versión en `go.mod`, 1.26+) + Echo v4, sqlx, `golang-jwt/jwt/v5`, bcrypt (vía `PasswordHasher`), `github.com/pquerna/otp` (TOTP — 003), AES-GCM-256 (cifrado MFA secret), `pkg/responses`, `pkg/logging`, `pkg/validators`, `pkg/errors`, `pkg/constants`
- PostgreSQL con sqlx — tablas `users`, `verification_tokens`, `password_history`, `system_config`, etc. (ver migraciones en `migrations/core/`)

## Project Structure

```text
internal/auth/          ← bounded context autenticación (login, signup, MFA, change-password)
  domain/ports/         ← interfaces: UserRepository, VerificationTokenRepository, TOTPProvider, MFASecretEncryptor, *MFAService
  domain/dtos/          ← DTOs por feature (login, signup, mfa, change_password)
  domain/entities/      ← User, Session, VerificationToken, AuditLog
  infrastructure/
    repositories/       ← sqlx adapters: user, session, audit, verification_token (003)
    security/           ← JWT, bcrypt, totp_provider (003), mfa_secret_encryptor (003)
    container/          ← AuthContainer (DI)
    openapi/            ← specs OpenAPI por feature
  usecases/             ← LoginUseCase, SignupUseCase, ChangePasswordUseCase, Setup/Confirm/Verify/DisableMFAUseCase (003)
  transport/
    handlers/           ← AuthHandler, SignupHandler, MFAHandler (003)
    routes/             ← auth_routes.go
    middleware/         ← AuthMiddleware (JWT)
  mocks/                ← generados por Mockery

migrations/core/        ← SQL secuencial 000000–000006
pkg/                    ← módulos Go reutilizables (go.work workspace)
cmd/composition/        ← DI raíz, router, bootstrap, OpenAPI
```

## Commands

```bash
# Verificar (lint + vet + fmt)
make verify

# Tests con coverage
make test-coverage

# Generar mocks de auth (incluye MFA desde 003)
make generate-auth-mocks
make generate-auth-mfa-mocks

# Formatear
make format

# Scaffolding de nuevo módulo
make scaffold MODULE=<nombre>
```

## Code Style

Go (see `go.mod`): gofumpt + goimports; errores con `%w`; context.Context en todo I/O; table-driven tests; mocks Mockery en `internal/<módulo>/mocks/`

## Recent Changes

- 003-mfa-totp-setup: MFA TOTP (RFC 6238) — setup, confirm, verify, disable; TOTPProvider (pquerna/otp); AES-GCM para secreto en reposo; fork MFA en LoginUseCase; VerificationTokenRepository adapter; migration 000006 (índices)
- 002-password-history: historial de contraseñas con políticas de reutilización

